{"thread":{"threadID":2945,"boardID":166,"topic":"Temporäre Regeländerung für Quick Hands","time":1441717009,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","lastPostTime":1442303740,"lastPoster":"Bara","replies":20,"views":2465,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":4},"tags":[{"tagID":385,"name":"Regel"}],"posts":[{"postID":36888,"threadID":2945,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","subject":"Temporäre Regeländerung für Quick Hands","time":1441717009,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1441717990,"value":1},{"userID":1962,"username":"Kentox","time":1441723018,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1441730942,"value":1},{"userID":1772,"username":"KAMIKAZE","time":1441794401,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Häufig missbrauchen die Ts Quick Hands als schnellen Gewinn eines LR&#x27;s, da neuerdings die AK Munition enthält.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bis dies gefixt ist, wäre ich für die Einführung einer Regel welche besagt, dass man bei Quick Hands nicht schummeln darf.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36890,"threadID":2945,"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","subject":"","time":1441717984,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bin ganz klar dafür! Auch ich habe Quickhands schon missbraucht um einen CT der mir vllt unsympathisch war bei Seite zu schaffen und dann mit den anderen einen vernünftigen !LR auszuführen. Fände es optimal wie du schon sagst , den T&#x27;s das schummeln bei diesem Spiel zu verbieten.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36894,"threadID":2945,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1441722900,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ehm, gilt nicht allgemein die Regel: Man darf beim LR nicht schummeln?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36896,"threadID":2945,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1441723555,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>kann man aufheben les die Regeln SaibahDroneks</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36903,"threadID":2945,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1441727250,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[dafuer*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36904,"threadID":2945,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1441728534,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>SaibahDRONIKS* <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/54-craxto/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Craxto</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ja ok dann brauchen wir eine Regel die besagt das man beim LR Quick Hands nicht schummeln darf. Ist das eigentlich nicht ein Bug? Also die Munition? Glaube mal schon, dann tritt wiederum die Regel Bugusing verboten ein.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36906,"threadID":2945,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","subject":"","time":1441729570,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>CyberTroniX</strong></cite><p>SaibahDRONIKS* <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/54-craxto/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Craxto</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ja ok dann brauchen wir eine Regel die besagt das man beim LR Quick Hands nicht schummeln darf. Ist das eigentlich nicht ein Bug? Also die Munition? Glaube mal schon, dann tritt wiederum die Regel Bugusing verboten ein.<br></p></blockquote><p>Wie soll das denn jemand wissen? Du kriegst die Waffe so in die Hand gedrückt, provozierst keinen Bug, also kein Bug using.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36909,"threadID":2945,"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","subject":"","time":1441730791,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1441733908,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wird langsam echt nervig, wenn die Ts einen  bestimmten CT unsympathisch finden  sollen sie diesen in z.B. einem fairen Knife Fight oder Noscope Duell besiegen.. Wenn sie verlieren haben sie halt pech gehabt.. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😛</span>   <span class=\"missing-media\">[dafuer*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36914,"threadID":2945,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1441732337,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1494-zescht/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Zescht</a> Man sollte aber nicht damit schießen können und das sollte jedem klar sein.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36916,"threadID":2945,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1441734950,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>um welches Spiel handelt es sich genau? Wird bestimmt kein Spiel innerhalb von Hosties sein.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36917,"threadID":2945,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1441735169,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hosties = ausm LR Menü? Wenn du es so meinst, Ja es ist ein !LR Game. Man ist in einem Kreis, der &quot;Arena&quot;, wenn man diese verlässt stirbt man. Es geht in dem Spiel &quot;Quick Hands&quot; darum wer es schafft, schneller die AK-47 dem Gegern zuzuwerfen. nach ca 30 Sekunden ist das Spiel beendet und der mit der schnellsten Zeit darf den Verlierer Knifen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36918,"threadID":2945,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1441735631,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hosties bietet eine API, also ist es kein Spiel von Hosties. Die Spiele von Hosties direkt sind hier gelistet: <a href=\"https://github.com/dataviruset/sm-hosties\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Das Spiel von dir ist hier gelistet ala separates Plugin: <a href=\"http://www.sourcemod.net/plugins.php?cat=0&amp;amp;mod=-1&amp;amp;title=Hosties&amp;amp;author=&amp;amp;description=&amp;amp;search=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36927,"threadID":2945,"userID":1933,"username":"Re(MiiX)","subject":"","time":1441741031,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wäre auf jedenfall dafür .</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36952,"threadID":2945,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1441784388,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>sowie ich es sehe (atm. kann ich nur mit Handy gucken), fehlt die Anpassung an reserve Ammo. Werde am WE mal schauen und soweit wies geht alle custom lrs in eine repo hochladen und updaten.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":36957,"threadID":2945,"userID":1772,"username":"KAMIKAZE","subject":"","time":1441794397,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[dafuer*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37123,"threadID":2945,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1442010516,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1525,"username":"Benni","time":1442044511,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://git.tf/Bara/CustomLRs/commit/709f86d152af8fce359ac626f906c4d0d5193ce5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Fixed </a><br><a href=\"http://git.tf/Bara/CustomLRs/tree/master/Quick%20Hands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37167,"threadID":2945,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","subject":"","time":1442140843,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a><br>Wird da was gemacht, denn es ist nicht gefixt auf dem Server.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37247,"threadID":2945,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"","time":1442243983,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Der Fix wurde installiert.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke <span class=\"mention\">@Bara</span>.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37298,"threadID":2945,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","subject":"","time":1442265122,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>LRs sind jetzt zum Teil total verbuggt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37302,"threadID":2945,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1442280441,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hier nochmal Danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/322-bara/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Bara</a> <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":37307,"threadID":2945,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1442303740,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1631,"username":"Der Joker aka XRAY","time":1442347445,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Zeschti</strong></cite><p>LRs sind jetzt zum Teil total verbuggt.<br></p></blockquote><p>Mein imaginäres Auto auch. Leider findet meine Glaskugel keine Lösung wegen zu wenig Informationen...</p>","polls":[]}]}